\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 INVINCIBLE DREAD is a drug-addled odyssey through, set in a world inspired by ancient Mesopotamia. Blood, guts, and who opine and nature of the divine, as well as a heavy helping of art history. The book stands complete at 130,000 words.}
